   1:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c **** /*
   2:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — pdfimg.c
   3:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * PDF raster-image extractor (see pdfimg.h). Scans the raw bytes for image
   4:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * XObject dictionaries ("<< ... /Subtype /Image ... >> stream"), reads /Width,
   5:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * /Height, /ColorSpace, /Filter and the following stream's data, inflates it
   6:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * when FlateDecode (reusing the PNG decoder's zlib inflate), and maps
   7:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * DeviceRGB/DeviceGray bytes to gray. DCTDecode (JPEG inside PDF) is handed
   8:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * to jpeg_decode. Vector-only PDFs yield NULL (caller falls back to the
   9:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  * unsupported-image path).
  10:Source/render/decoders/pdfimg.c ****  */
